            "Email already exists: " + email
        );
    }
}

@Service
public class UserService {
    private final UserRepository repository;

    public UserResponse getUser(String id) {
        User user = repository
            .findById(id)
            .orElseThrow(
                () -> new UserNotFoundException(id)
            );

        return new UserResponse(
            user.getId(),
            user.getName(),
            user.getEmail()
        );
    }

